OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office suspends sending goods
OL,4,Ato the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man Post Office has stopped
OL,7,Faccepting goods for delivery to
OL,8,FEuropean Union countries until further
OL,9,Fnotice.
OL,11,FIt said third-party systems used to
OL,12,Fprocess international parcels were
OL,13,Fbeing updated ahead of changes to EU
OL,14,Fcustoms requirements, but were not yet
OL,15,Fready.
OL,17,FDocuments can still be sent to EU
OL,18,Faddresses, and goods can still be
OL,19,Fposted to the rest of the world,
OL,20,Fincluding the USA.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
