OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office suspends sending goods
OL,4,Ato the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office said it had been
OL,7,Fpreparing for the changes, but "an
OL,8,Funexpected change in approach by one of
OL,9,Four UK partners" meant further work was
OL,10,Fneeded.
